| meta-LR on `log(p)`, C=0.1 | 0.23683 |
| meta-LR, + per-model temperature scaling | 0.23665 (no gain) |
**Findings:** (1) with more members the optimal C drifts *down* — try C≈0.02 not 0.03; (2) per-model temperature calibration gives **no** gain (meta-LR already re-weights scale); (3) 23 members now = 0.2365, better than 18-member 0.2469 ([[antares_iota_final_coordination.md]]).
